<title>USA: Handy &amp; Harman Q3 oper shr $0.41 rises.</title>
<headline>Handy &amp; Harman Q3 oper shr $0.41 rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr	   $0.41		    $0.17</p>
<p> Oper net	   5,684		    2,380</p>
<p> Sales		95,890		   99,876</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   14,000		   14,103</p>
<p>			Nine months</p>
<p> Oper shr	   $1.04		    $0.37</p>
<p> Oper net	   14,501		   5,196</p>
<p> Sales		310,036		  327,966</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   13,972		   14,097</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Nine months 1996 includes after-tax charge of $0.59 per share in the first quarter from the sale of the company's refining division business.</p>
<p>Nine months 1995 discontinued operations include sale of company's automotive original equipment business.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
